x86_64-windows  a polymorphic virtual base is refused by name for this target: the Microsoft ABI dispatches through one with vtordisp fields and thunks of its own, measured for no class yet. The Itanium targets and the C6000 write the whole of it - the slots, the secondary table with its vcall offsets and virtual thunks, the VTT and the construction vtables - and this case measures those.
